# KobeanTest Global Constraints

- **100% Localhost First**: All data is stored locally in SQLite (`kobean.db`). Zero external cloud calls.
- **Speed is #1**: Perceived latency < 16ms. Optimistic UI updates. Sub-5ms SQLite search.
- **Ponytail Minimalism**: Write the least code necessary. Standard library first. No overengineering.
- **Zero License Cost**: 100% Free & Open Source (MIT, Apache 2.0). Never introduce commercial or paywalled packages.
- **Linear-Grade Elegance**: 1px subtle borders, Geist/Inter typography, tabular numbers, 1.75px Lucide icons.
